          "text": "GenLayer lets a group of independent validators answer questions that need judgment, such as whether a freelancer's delivered logo matches the brief. Each validator runs the question itself, and the answer is only accepted when they agree. If someone thinks the answer is wrong, they can appeal, and a larger group of validators looks at it again.",
